; Regression test for H-CHECK-SETE-DIAGNOSTICS: negative-control proof that
; the pre-fix `VAR=$(cmd); CODE=$?` shape under `set -e` dies silently when
; the command fails, and that jj_workspace_smoke.sh's current
; `&& CODE=0 || CODE=$?` shape survives the same failure with a diagnostic.
; Invokes jj_workspace_smoke.sh with a fake `jj` on PATH; declares it as an
; explicit dep so the cache invalidates when that script's logic changes.
; Also exercises the unreadable-file diagnostic in magic_numbers_linter.exe
; (Part 4) -- MAGIC_NUMBERS_LINTER_EXE points the script at the built exe
