; git-error path. Copies the linter (+ _check_lib.sh) into its own fixture
; dirs with controlled linter_exceptions.conf content, so it never depends
; on this repo's real linter_exceptions.conf or real tracked git state --
; no (universe) needed. See tracked_artifact_linter_test.sh's header for
; the full fixture design.

